From 119a94cdfa9ee54b762bc1317f8a03ed565c11db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rahil Bhavan <rbhavanzim@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:37:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Research exhibits: a range form (a run against its spread,
 mean marker, both axis ends) and an optional footer ink

Adds the `range` form, an optional `foot_ink` theme colour for the footer text and a hand-written `alt` that
`pd research hubspec` keeps in place of the generated one. Used by the Oct 28 MEV cards (request cr-3845f126).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
